 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Added read-only extension `ctx.getStatusLineMetrics()` for the host-resolved compaction trigger, native session generation meter and native active-scope cached quota, with explicit disabled/unavailable states and no additional usage fetches.
+- Added read-only `ctx.ui.getStatus(key)` for live, exact keyed native status text shared between extensions; absent keys and hosts without native status storage return `undefined`, without rendering or external fetches.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Keep native status-line quota and extension metrics aligned with the session's latest usage reports after `/usage` refreshes and saved resets, without fetching on render or mixing provider/account/model scopes.
+
